+++ b/docs/api/sections/search.md
@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+# Search
+
+Search finds cards by what's written in them: their title, their description, or the body of
+any of their comments. Only cards on boards you have access to are returned, and drafted cards
+are never included.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/search?q=term`
+
+Returns the cards matching every term in `q`, newest first.
+
+__Parameters:__
+
+- `q` — the terms to search for, separated by spaces.
+- `page` — the page of results to return.
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+    "number": 42,
+    "title": "The logo isn't big enough",
+    "status": "published",
+    "description": "It gets lost on small screens",
+    "description_html": "<div>It gets lost on small screens</div>",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/42"
+  }
+]
+```
+
+Card attributes are the same as the ones returned by [the cards endpoints](cards.md).
